Package: devjam-archive-keyring-legacy
Version: 1.43-1
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Signing keys for the dev-jam apt repositories (legacy)
 OpenPGP keys that sign the dev-jam apt repository and the dev-jam
 external repository, installed in /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d for Debian
 Live images that still use sources.list without Signed-By. Use devjam-archive-keyring on other
 systems; this package will be dropped once Debian Live handles
 deb822 .sources files.
